      "richText": "<article class=\"markdown-body entry-content container-lg\" itemprop=\"text\"><div class=\"markdown-heading\" dir=\"auto\"><h1 tabindex=\"-1\" class=\"heading-element\" dir=\"auto\">Agentic Trigger.dev Framework</h1><a id=\"user-content-agentic-triggerdev-framework\" class=\"anchor\" aria-label=\"Permalink: Agentic Trigger.dev Framework\" href=\"#agentic-triggerdev-framework\"><svg data-component=\"Octicon\" class=\"octicon octicon-link\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" version=\"1.1\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m7.775 3.275 1.25-1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1 4.95 4.95l-2.5 2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1-4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1 .018-1.042.751.751 0 0 1 1.042-.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l2.5-2.5a2.002 2.002 0 0 0-2.83-2.83l-1.25 1.25a.751.751 0 0 1-1.042-.018.751.751 0 0 1-.018-1.042Zm-4.69 9.64a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l1.25-1.25a.751.751 0 0 1 1.042.018.751.751 0 0 1 .018 1.042l-1.25 1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1-4.95-4.95l2.5-2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1-.018 1.042.751.751 0 0 1-1.042.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0-2.83 0l-2.5 2.5a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 0 2.83Z\"></path></svg></a></div>\n<p dir=\"auto\">This project framework allows you to create deterministic, background workflows using <strong>Trigger.dev v3</strong>, with an added \"Agentic Layer\" that allows you to generate these workflows using natural language (powered by Google Gemini).</p>\n<div class=\"markdown-heading\" dir=\"auto\"><h2 tabindex=\"-1\" class=\"heading-element\" dir=\"auto\">Features</h2><a id=\"user-content-features\" class=\"anchor\" aria-label=\"Permalink: Features\" href=\"#features\"><svg data-component=\"Octicon\" class=\"octicon octicon-link\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" version=\"1.1\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m7.775 3.275 1.25-1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1 4.95 4.95l-2.5 2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1-4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1 .018-1.042.751.751 0 0 1 1.042-.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l2.5-2.5a2.002 2.002 0 0 0-2.83-2.83l-1.25 1.25a.751.751 0 0 1-1.042-.018.751.751 0 0 1-.018-1.042Zm-4.69 9.64a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l1.25-1.25a.751.751 0 0 1 1.042.018.751.751 0 0 1 .018 1.042l-1.25 1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1-4.95-4.95l2.5-2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1-.018 1.042.751.751 0 0 1-1.042.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0-2.83 0l-2.5 2.5a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 0 2.83Z\"></path></svg></a></div>\n<ul dir=\"auto\">\n<li><strong>Deterministic Execution</strong>: Uses Trigger.dev v3SDK for reliable, retriable, and durable task execution.</li>\n<li><strong>Agentic Builder</strong>: A CLI tool that uses Google's Gemini 1.5 Flash to write valid Trigger.dev TypeScript code from your text prompts.</li>\n<li><strong>Developer First</strong>: Fully customizable TypeScript code.</li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"markdown-heading\" dir=\"auto\"><h2 tabindex=\"-1\" class=\"heading-element\" dir=\"auto\">Setup</h2><a id=\"user-content-setup\" class=\"anchor\" aria-label=\"Permalink: Setup\" href=\"#setup\"><svg data-component=\"Octicon\" class=\"octicon octicon-link\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" version=\"1.1\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m7.775 3.275 1.25-1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1 4.95 4.95l-2.5 2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1-4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1 .018-1.042.751.751 0 0 1 1.042-.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l2.5-2.5a2.002 2.002 0 0 0-2.83-2.83l-1.25 1.25a.751.751 0 0 1-1.042-.018.751.751 0 0 1-.018-1.042Zm-4.69 9.64a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l1.25-1.25a.751.751 0 0 1 1.042.018.751.751 0 0 1 .018 1.042l-1.25 1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1-4.95-4.95l2.5-2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1-.018 1.042.751.751 0 0 1-1.042.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0-2.83 0l-2.5 2.5a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 0 2.83Z\"></path></svg></a></div>\n<ol dir=\"auto\">\n<li>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><strong>Install Dependencies</strong>:</p>\n<div class=\"highlight highlight-source-shell notranslate position-relative overflow-auto\" dir=\"auto\" data-snippet-clipboard-copy-content=\"npm install\"><pre>npm install</pre></div>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><strong>Environment Variables</strong>:\nCopy <code>.env.example</code> to <code>.env</code> and fill in your keys:</p>\n<div class=\"highlight highlight-source-shell notranslate position-relative overflow-auto\" dir=\"auto\" data-snippet-clipboard-copy-content=\"cp .env.example .env\"><pre>cp .env.example .env</pre></div>\n<ul dir=\"auto\">\n<li><code>GOOGLE_API_KEY</code>: Your Google Gemini API Key.</li>\n<li><code>TRIGGER_SECRET_KEY</code>: Your Trigger.dev Secret Key (production).</li>\n<li><code>TRIGGER_SECRET_KEY_STAGING</code>: Your Trigger.dev Secret Key (staging/development).</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><strong>Trigger Project</strong>:\nEnsure <code>trigger.config.ts</code> has your correct Project ID.</p>\n</li>\n</ol>\n<div class=\"markdown-heading\" dir=\"auto\"><h2 tabindex=\"-1\" class=\"heading-element\" dir=\"auto\">Usage</h2><a id=\"user-content-usage\" class=\"anchor\" aria-label=\"Permalink: Usage\" href=\"#usage\"><svg data-component=\"Octicon\" class=\"octicon octicon-link\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" version=\"1.1\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m7.775 3.275 1.25-1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1 4.95 4.95l-2.5 2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1-4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1 .018-1.042.751.751 0 0 1 1.042-.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l2.5-2.5a2.002 2.002 0 0 0-2.83-2.83l-1.25 1.25a.751.751 0 0 1-1.042-.018.751.751 0 0 1-.018-1.042Zm-4.69 9.64a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l1.25-1.25a.751.751 0 0 1 1.042.018.751.751 0 0 1 .018 1.042l-1.25 1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1-4.95-4.95l2.5-2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1-.018 1.042.751.751 0 0 1-1.042.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0-2.83 0l-2.5 2.5a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 0 2.83Z\"></path></svg></a></div>\n<div class=\"markdown-heading\" dir=\"auto\"><h3 tabindex=\"-1\" class=\"heading-element\" dir=\"auto\">Running the Runtime</h3><a id=\"user-content-running-the-runtime\" class=\"anchor\" aria-label=\"Permalink: Running the Runtime\" href=\"#running-the-runtime\"><svg data-component=\"Octicon\" class=\"octicon octicon-link\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" version=\"1.1\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m7.775 3.275 1.25-1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1 4.95 4.95l-2.5 2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1-4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1 .018-1.042.751.751 0 0 1 1.042-.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l2.5-2.5a2.002 2.002 0 0 0-2.83-2.83l-1.25 1.25a.751.751 0 0 1-1.042-.018.751.751 0 0 1-.018-1.042Zm-4.69 9.64a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l1.25-1.25a.751.751 0 0 1 1.042.018.751.751 0 0 1 .018 1.042l-1.25 1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1-4.95-4.95l2.5-2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1-.018 1.042.751.751 0 0 1-1.042.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0-2.83 0l-2.5 2.5a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 0 2.83Z\"></path></svg></a></div>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Start the dev server to run your defined tasks:</p>\n<div class=\"highlight highlight-source-shell notranslate position-relative overflow-auto\" dir=\"auto\" data-snippet-clipboard-copy-content=\"npm run dev\"><pre>npm run dev</pre></div>\n<div class=\"markdown-heading\" dir=\"auto\"><h3 tabindex=\"-1\" class=\"heading-element\" dir=\"auto\">Deploying to Production</h3><a id=\"user-content-deploying-to-production\" class=\"anchor\" aria-label=\"Permalink: Deploying to Production\" href=\"#deploying-to-production\"><svg data-component=\"Octicon\" class=\"octicon octicon-link\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" version=\"1.1\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m7.775 3.275 1.25-1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1 4.95 4.95l-2.5 2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1-4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1 .018-1.042.751.751 0 0 1 1.042-.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l2.5-2.5a2.002 2.002 0 0 0-2.83-2.83l-1.25 1.25a.751.751 0 0 1-1.042-.018.751.751 0 0 1-.018-1.042Zm-4.69 9.64a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l1.25-1.25a.751.751 0 0 1 1.042.018.751.751 0 0 1 .018 1.042l-1.25 1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1-4.95-4.95l2.5-2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1-.018 1.042.751.751 0 0 1-1.042.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0-2.83 0l-2.5 2.5a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 0 2.83Z\"></path></svg></a></div>\n<p dir=\"auto\">To deploy your tasks to the Trigger.dev cloud platform:</p>\n<div class=\"highlight highlight-source-shell notranslate position-relative overflow-auto\" dir=\"auto\" data-snippet-clipboard-copy-content=\"npm run deploy\"><pre>npm run deploy</pre></div>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Follow the interactive prompts to authorize and select your project.</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">For more information, visit the <a href=\"https://trigger.dev/docs/deployment/overview\" rel=\"nofollow\">deployment documentation</a>.</p>\n<div class=\"markdown-heading\" dir=\"auto\"><h3 tabindex=\"-1\" class=\"heading-element\" dir=\"auto\">Webhook Server Deployment (Choose One)</h3><a id=\"user-content-webhook-server-deployment-choose-one\" class=\"anchor\" aria-label=\"Permalink: Webhook Server Deployment (Choose One)\" href=\"#webhook-server-deployment-choose-one\"><svg data-component=\"Octicon\" class=\"octicon octicon-link\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" version=\"1.1\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m7.775 3.275 1.25-1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1 4.95 4.95l-2.5 2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1-4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1 .018-1.042.751.751 0 0 1 1.042-.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l2.5-2.5a2.002 2.002 0 0 0-2.83-2.83l-1.25 1.25a.751.751 0 0 1-1.042-.018.751.751 0 0 1-.018-1.042Zm-4.69 9.64a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l1.25-1.25a.751.751 0 0 1 1.042.018.751.751 0 0 1 .018 1.042l-1.25 1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1-4.95-4.95l2.5-2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1-.018 1.042.751.751 0 0 1-1.042.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0-2.83 0l-2.5 2.5a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 0 2.83Z\"></path></svg></a></div>\n<p dir=\"auto\">The webhook server lets external services trigger your Trigger.dev tasks via HTTP. <strong>Choose one deployment option:</strong></p>\n<markdown-accessiblity-table><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>Option</th>\n<th>Command</th>\n<th>Best For</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>Docker/Render</strong></td>\n<td><code>docker-compose up -d</code></td>\n<td>Traditional hosting, no cold starts</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>Modal</strong></td>\n<td><code>modal deploy modal_app.py</code></td>\n<td>Serverless, pay-per-use</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table></markdown-accessiblity-table>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><strong>Option A: Docker/Render (Node.js)</strong></p>\n<div class=\"highlight highlight-source-shell notranslate position-relative overflow-auto\" dir=\"auto\" data-snippet-clipboard-copy-content=\"docker-compose up -d\n# Server at http://localhost:3000\"><pre>docker-compose up -d\n<span class=\"pl-c\"><span class=\"pl-c\">#</span> Server at http://localhost:3000</span></pre></div>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><strong>Option B: Modal (Python/Serverless)</strong></p>\n<div class=\"highlight highlight-source-shell notranslate position-relative overflow-auto\" dir=\"auto\" data-snippet-clipboard-copy-content=\"pip install modal\nmodal token new\nmodal secret create trigger-secrets \\\n  TRIGGER_SECRET_KEY=your_prod_key \\\n  TRIGGER_SECRET_KEY_STAGING=your_staging_key\nmodal deploy modal_app.py\n# Server at https://&lt;username&gt;--antigravity-webhook-fastapi-app.modal.run\"><pre>pip install modal\nmodal token new\nmodal secret create trigger-secrets \\\n  TRIGGER_SECRET_KEY=your_prod_key \\\n  TRIGGER_SECRET_KEY_STAGING=your_staging_key\nmodal deploy modal_app.py\n<span class=\"pl-c\"><span class=\"pl-c\">#</span> Server at https://&lt;username&gt;--antigravity-webhook-fastapi-app.modal.run</span></pre></div>\n<p dir=\"auto\">📖 <strong>Full guide:</strong> <a href=\"/jannismoore/antigravity-trigger-dev/blob/main/docs/WEBHOOK_INTEGRATION.md\">Webhook Integration</a></p>\n<div class=\"markdown-heading\" dir=\"auto\"><h3 tabindex=\"-1\" class=\"heading-element\" dir=\"auto\">Creating Workflows with AI</h3><a id=\"user-content-creating-workflows-with-ai\" class=\"anchor\" aria-label=\"Permalink: Creating Workflows with AI\" href=\"#creating-workflows-with-ai\"><svg data-component=\"Octicon\" class=\"octicon octicon-link\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" version=\"1.1\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m7.775 3.275 1.25-1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1 4.95 4.95l-2.5 2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1-4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1 .018-1.042.751.751 0 0 1 1.042-.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l2.5-2.5a2.002 2.002 0 0 0-2.83-2.83l-1.25 1.25a.751.751 0 0 1-1.042-.018.751.751 0 0 1-.018-1.042Zm-4.69 9.64a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l1.25-1.25a.751.751 0 0 1 1.042.018.751.751 0 0 1 .018 1.042l-1.25 1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1-4.95-4.95l2.5-2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1-.018 1.042.751.751 0 0 1-1.042.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0-2.83 0l-2.5 2.5a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 0 2.83Z\"></path></svg></a></div>\n<p dir=\"auto\">You can generate a new workflow by describing it:</p>\n<div class=\"highlight highlight-source-shell notranslate position-relative overflow-auto\" dir=\"auto\" data-snippet-clipboard-copy-content=\"npm run create-workflow &quot;Create a task that runs every 5 minutes and checks an API endpoint&quot;\"><pre>npm run create-workflow <span class=\"pl-s\"><span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span>Create a task that runs every 5 minutes and checks an API endpoint<span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span></span></pre></div>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Or use the integrated Agent Workflow if running within the Antigravity environment.</p>\n<div class=\"markdown-heading\" dir=\"auto\"><h2 tabindex=\"-1\" class=\"heading-element\" dir=\"auto\">Debugging</h2><a id=\"user-content-debugging\" class=\"anchor\" aria-label=\"Permalink: Debugging\" href=\"#debugging\"><svg data-component=\"Octicon\" class=\"octicon octicon-link\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" version=\"1.1\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m7.775 3.275 1.25-1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1 4.95 4.95l-2.5 2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1-4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1 .018-1.042.751.751 0 0 1 1.042-.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l2.5-2.5a2.002 2.002 0 0 0-2.83-2.83l-1.25 1.25a.751.751 0 0 1-1.042-.018.751.751 0 0 1-.018-1.042Zm-4.69 9.64a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l1.25-1.25a.751.751 0 0 1 1.042.018.751.751 0 0 1 .018 1.042l-1.25 1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1-4.95-4.95l2.5-2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1-.018 1.042.751.751 0 0 1-1.042.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0-2.83 0l-2.5 2.5a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 0 2.83Z\"></path></svg></a></div>\n<div class=\"markdown-heading\" dir=\"auto\"><h3 tabindex=\"-1\" class=\"heading-element\" dir=\"auto\">Run Snapshots</h3><a id=\"user-content-run-snapshots\" class=\"anchor\" aria-label=\"Permalink: Run Snapshots\" href=\"#run-snapshots\"><svg data-component=\"Octicon\" class=\"octicon octicon-link\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" version=\"1.1\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m7.775 3.275 1.25-1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1 4.95 4.95l-2.5 2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1-4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1 .018-1.042.751.751 0 0 1 1.042-.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l2.5-2.5a2.002 2.002 0 0 0-2.83-2.83l-1.25 1.25a.751.751 0 0 1-1.042-.018.751.751 0 0 1-.018-1.042Zm-4.69 9.64a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l1.25-1.25a.751.751 0 0 1 1.042.018.751.751 0 0 1 .018 1.042l-1.25 1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1-4.95-4.95l2.5-2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1-.018 1.042.751.751 0 0 1-1.042.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0-2.83 0l-2.5 2.5a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 0 2.83Z\"></path></svg></a></div>\n<p dir=\"auto\">To help agents debug failed runs, you can capture a snapshot of the latest run's inputs, outputs, and errors.</p>\n<ul dir=\"auto\">\n<li>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><strong>Development</strong>:</p>\n<div class=\"highlight highlight-source-shell notranslate position-relative overflow-auto\" dir=\"auto\" data-snippet-clipboard-copy-content=\"npm run snapshot:dev\"><pre>npm run snapshot:dev</pre></div>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><strong>Production</strong>:</p>\n<div class=\"highlight highlight-source-shell notranslate position-relative overflow-auto\" dir=\"auto\" data-snippet-clipboard-copy-content=\"npm run snapshot:prod\"><pre>npm run snapshot:prod</pre></div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Snapshots are saved to <code>.agent/snapshots/latest.md</code>.</p>\n<div class=\"markdown-heading\" dir=\"auto\"><h2 tabindex=\"-1\" class=\"heading-element\" dir=\"auto\">Directory Structure</h2><a id=\"user-content-directory-structure\" class=\"anchor\" aria-label=\"Permalink: Directory Structure\" href=\"#directory-structure\"><svg data-component=\"Octicon\" class=\"octicon octicon-link\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" version=\"1.1\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m7.775 3.275 1.25-1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1 4.95 4.95l-2.5 2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1-4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1 .018-1.042.751.751 0 0 1 1.042-.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l2.5-2.5a2.002 2.002 0 0 0-2.83-2.83l-1.25 1.25a.751.751 0 0 1-1.042-.018.751.751 0 0 1-.018-1.042Zm-4.69 9.64a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l1.25-1.25a.751.751 0 0 1 1.042.018.751.751 0 0 1 .018 1.042l-1.25 1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1-4.95-4.95l2.5-2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1-.018 1.042.751.751 0 0 1-1.042.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0-2.83 0l-2.5 2.5a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 0 2.83Z\"></path></svg></a></div>\n<ul dir=\"auto\">\n<li><code>src/trigger/</code>: Where your workflow task files live.</li>\n<li><code>src/agent/</code>: The code for the Agentic Builder.</li>\n<li><code>src/webapp/</code>: The Hono web server for webhooks (Node.js/Docker).</li>\n<li><code>src/webapp_modal/</code>: The FastAPI web server for webhooks (Python/Modal).</li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"markdown-heading\" dir=\"auto\"><h2 tabindex=\"-1\" class=\"heading-element\" dir=\"auto\">Webhook API</h2><a id=\"user-content-webhook-api\" class=\"anchor\" aria-label=\"Permalink: Webhook API\" href=\"#webhook-api\"><svg data-component=\"Octicon\" class=\"octicon octicon-link\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" version=\"1.1\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m7.775 3.275 1.25-1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1 4.95 4.95l-2.5 2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1-4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1 .018-1.042.751.751 0 0 1 1.042-.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l2.5-2.5a2.002 2.002 0 0 0-2.83-2.83l-1.25 1.25a.751.751 0 0 1-1.042-.018.751.751 0 0 1-.018-1.042Zm-4.69 9.64a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l1.25-1.25a.751.751 0 0 1 1.042.018.751.751 0 0 1 .018 1.042l-1.25 1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1-4.95-4.95l2.5-2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1-.018 1.042.751.751 0 0 1-1.042.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0-2.83 0l-2.5 2.5a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 0 2.83Z\"></path></svg></a></div>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Trigger tasks via HTTP using the webhook server (see <a href=\"#webhook-server-deployment-choose-one\">deployment options</a> above).</p>\n<div class=\"markdown-heading\" dir=\"auto\"><h3 tabindex=\"-1\" class=\"heading-element\" dir=\"auto\">Endpoint</h3><a id=\"user-content-endpoint\" class=\"anchor\" aria-label=\"Permalink: Endpoint\" href=\"#endpoint\"><svg data-component=\"Octicon\" class=\"octicon octicon-link\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" version=\"1.1\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m7.775 3.275 1.25-1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1 4.95 4.95l-2.5 2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1-4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1 .018-1.042.751.751 0 0 1 1.042-.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l2.5-2.5a2.002 2.002 0 0 0-2.83-2.83l-1.25 1.25a.751.751 0 0 1-1.042-.018.751.751 0 0 1-.018-1.042Zm-4.69 9.64a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l1.25-1.25a.751.751 0 0 1 1.042.018.751.751 0 0 1 .018 1.042l-1.25 1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1-4.95-4.95l2.5-2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1-.018 1.042.751.751 0 0 1-1.042.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0-2.83 0l-2.5 2.5a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 0 2.83Z\"></path></svg></a></div>\n<div class=\"snippet-clipboard-content notranslate position-relative overflow-auto\" data-snippet-clipboard-copy-content=\"POST /api/webhooks/{env}/{taskId}\"><pre class=\"notranslate\"><code>POST /api/webhooks/{env}/{taskId}\n</code></pre></div>\n<ul dir=\"auto\">\n<li><code>env</code>: <code>production</code> or <code>staging</code></li>\n<li><code>taskId</code>: Your Trigger.dev task ID</li>\n<li><code>mode=sync</code> (optional): Wait for task completion</li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"markdown-heading\" dir=\"auto\"><h3 tabindex=\"-1\" class=\"heading-element\" dir=\"auto\">Examples</h3><a id=\"user-content-examples\" class=\"anchor\" aria-label=\"Permalink: Examples\" href=\"#examples\"><svg data-component=\"Octicon\" class=\"octicon octicon-link\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" version=\"1.1\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m7.775 3.275 1.25-1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1 4.95 4.95l-2.5 2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1-4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1 .018-1.042.751.751 0 0 1 1.042-.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l2.5-2.5a2.002 2.002 0 0 0-2.83-2.83l-1.25 1.25a.751.751 0 0 1-1.042-.018.751.751 0 0 1-.018-1.042Zm-4.69 9.64a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l1.25-1.25a.751.751 0 0 1 1.042.018.751.751 0 0 1 .018 1.042l-1.25 1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1-4.95-4.95l2.5-2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1-.018 1.042.751.751 0 0 1-1.042.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0-2.83 0l-2.5 2.5a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 0 2.83Z\"></path></svg></a></div>\n<div class=\"highlight highlight-source-shell notranslate position-relative overflow-auto\" dir=\"auto\" data-snippet-clipboard-copy-content=\"# Async (returns immediately)\ncurl -X POST &quot;https://your-server/api/webhooks/production/answer-question&quot; \\\n  -H &quot;Content-Type: application/json&quot; \\\n  -d '{&quot;question&quot;: &quot;What is AI?&quot;}'\n\n# Sync (waits for completion)\ncurl -X POST &quot;https://your-server/api/webhooks/production/answer-question?mode=sync&quot; \\\n  -H &quot;Content-Type: application/json&quot; \\\n  -d '{&quot;question&quot;: &quot;What is AI?&quot;}'\n\n# With authentication\ncurl -X POST &quot;https://your-server/api/webhooks/production/answer-question?agtr_secret=your_secret&quot; \\\n  -H &quot;Content-Type: application/json&quot; \\\n  -d '{&quot;question&quot;: &quot;What is AI?&quot;}'\"><pre><span class=\"pl-c\"><span class=\"pl-c\">#</span> Async (returns immediately)</span>\ncurl -X POST <span class=\"pl-s\"><span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span>https://your-server/api/webhooks/production/answer-question<span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span></span> \\\n  -H <span class=\"pl-s\"><span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span>Content-Type: application/json<span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span></span> \\\n  -d <span class=\"pl-s\"><span class=\"pl-pds\">'</span>{\"question\": \"What is AI?\"}<span class=\"pl-pds\">'</span></span>\n\n<span class=\"pl-c\"><span class=\"pl-c\">#</span> Sync (waits for completion)</span>\ncurl -X POST <span class=\"pl-s\"><span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span>https://your-server/api/webhooks/production/answer-question?mode=sync<span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span></span> \\\n  -H <span class=\"pl-s\"><span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span>Content-Type: application/json<span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span></span> \\\n  -d <span class=\"pl-s\"><span class=\"pl-pds\">'</span>{\"question\": \"What is AI?\"}<span class=\"pl-pds\">'</span></span>\n\n<span class=\"pl-c\"><span class=\"pl-c\">#</span> With authentication</span>\ncurl -X POST <span class=\"pl-s\"><span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span>https://your-server/api/webhooks/production/answer-question?agtr_secret=your_secret<span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span></span> \\\n  -H <span class=\"pl-s\"><span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span>Content-Type: application/json<span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span></span> \\\n  -d <span class=\"pl-s\"><span class=\"pl-pds\">'</span>{\"question\": \"What is AI?\"}<span class=\"pl-pds\">'</span></span></pre></div>\n<p dir=\"auto\">📖 <strong>Full API reference:</strong> <a href=\"/jannismoore/antigravity-trigger-dev/blob/main/docs/WEBHOOK_INTEGRATION.md\">Webhook Integration</a></p>\n</article>",
